        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Paper, woodfree, coated, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Paper, woodfree, coated, at regional storage
na;
UUID: 7d1dc73b-254b-3f69-93ad-0f0bec5075ae
This module includes the transport from the production site to a central distribution site within Switzerland for the domestic and the foreign coated fine paper consumed in Switzerland.; Geography: Deliveries within/to Switzerland according to official Swiss trade statistics with country-specific transport distances.
Location: Deliveries within/to Switzerland according to official Swiss trade statistics with country-specific transport distances.
Technology: Average situation
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Total Swiss graphic paper consumption 2000: 725.8 kt (official statistics)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: Standard distances for domestic production, imports from neighbourhood countries and imports from scandinavian countries. Distribution integrated / non-integrated mill based on own assumption.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7d1dc73b-254b-3f69-93ad-0f0bec5075ae.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
